p id=3D"e2c8" class=3D"pw-post-body-paragraph mf mg gq mh b mi mj mk ml mm =
mn mo mp mq mr ms mt mu mv mw mx my mz na nb nc gj cc" data-selectable-para=
graph=3D"">I=E2=80=99ve worked with K8s in various settings for years, and =
I=E2=80=99ve never felt any real desire to get a certification. It was alwa=
ys more important to me to know K8s than to get a piece of paper that says =
I know K8s, but a new year is upon us, and well, why not? So, I figure I=E2=
=80=99ll jot down some notes as I prep for the Certified Kubernetes Admin e=
xam, and maybe this will be helpful for other folks who endeavor to get a p=
iece of paper with K8s in the title.</p><p id=3D"4df9" class=3D"pw-post-bod=
y-paragraph mf mg gq mh b mi mj mk ml mm mn mo mp mq mr ms mt mu mv mw mx m=
y mz na nb nc gj cc" data-selectable-paragraph=3D"">My experience has alway=
s been with either managed clusters or locally provisioned clusters like Ki=
nD or Minikube, so my node admin skills are the first place I=E2=80=99m goi=
ng to drill. In the interest of doing so in a way that parallels the exam f=
ormat, I=E2=80=99m spinning up a bare metal K8s cluster in Digital Ocean sp=
ecifically because it is the cheapest way to spin up the bare metal Ubuntu =
machines I=E2=80=99ll be using as nodes in my cluster without having to spe=
nd precious time and thinkin=E2=80=99 powers on the VMs themselves.</p><p i=
d=3D"aa86" class=3D"pw-post-body-paragraph mf mg gq mh b mi mj mk ml mm mn =
mo mp mq mr ms mt mu mv mw mx my mz na nb nc gj cc" data-selectable-paragra=
ph=3D"">Anyhow, this will be a two node cluster running on Ubuntu 24.04 nod=
es. Each node will have 2 vCPUs (the install process with <code class=3D"dk=
 nd ne nf ng b">kubeadm</code> requires 2 CPUs for the control plane, FYI).=
</p><blockquote class=3D"nh ni nj"><p id=3D"b9a9" class=3D"mf mg nk mh b mi=
 mj mk ml mm mn mo mp mq mr ms mt mu mv mw mx my mz na nb nc gj cc" data-se=
lectable-paragraph=3D"">Shout out to <a class=3D"as nl" rel=3D"noopener" hr=
ef=3D"https://medium.com/@subhampradhan966?source=3Dpost_page---byline--f6a=
5fc67f0df---------------------------------------" data-discover=3D"true">Su=
bham Pradhan</a> for his very helpful <a class=3D"as nl" rel=3D"noopener" h=
ref=3D"https://medium.com/@subhampradhan966/kubeadm-setup-for-ubuntu-24-04-=
lts-f6a5fc67f0df" data-discover=3D"true">blog post on the topic</a>.</p></b=
lockquote><p id=3D"6ded" class=3D"pw-post-body-paragraph mf mg gq mh b mi m=
j mk ml mm mn mo mp mq mr ms mt mu mv mw mx my mz na nb nc gj cc" data-sele=
ctable-paragraph=3D"">And I=E2=80=99ll name my nodes <code class=3D"dk nd n=
e nf ng b">control-plane</code> and <code class=3D"dk nd ne nf ng b">worker=
</code> respectively.</p><figure class=3D"np nq nr ns nt nu nm nn paragraph=
